# Store every file byte for byte. Some files are CRLF, and the monorepo root attributes (LF normalisation,
# PNG in Git LFS) must not rewrite them when this capsule is tracked there or published by subtree split.
* -text
# PNG files stay plain blobs, not Git LFS pointers: Vercel deploys them from the capsule repository.
*.png -filter -diff -merge -text
